cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you reference the TH Analytica Framework, please cite it using this metadata."
title: "TH Analytica Framework"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: "Hullin"
    given-names: "Thomas"
    affiliation: "TH Analytica"
    email: "thomas@th-analytica.com"
url: "https://th-analytica.com/methodik"
repository-code: "https://github.com/Thom-Code-Cell/th-analytica-framework"
abstract: >-
  A public methodology for assessing the technical and semantic conditions
  that help people, search systems and AI-assisted retrieval interpret a
  website consistently. It covers accessibility, entity clarity, structured
  data, evidence, citation readiness, agent readiness, governance and human
  approval. The framework does not guarantee rankings, citations, mentions,
  recommendations, leads or revenue.
keywords:
  - "AI Visibility"
  - "Agent Readiness"
  - "AI Citation Readiness"
  - "Entity Clarity"
  - "Structured Data"
  - "AI Governance"
